mapping "V1013.1" source="V1013" target="47397001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V1013 is the Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of parent V101 (passagerare på cykel skadad i
        olycka, ej trafik) with an activity suffix (idrott/lek/förvärvsarbete/etc.). The activity suffix
        is Swedish national context metadata with no SNOMED CT analogue; clinically the source denotes the
        same pedal-cycle collision as its parent. Primary target SNOMED CT 433099 (Victim, cyclist in
        vehicular AND/OR traffic accident) is the parent's verified SNOMED CT 21107000 214640008 47397001
        crosswalk target in the athena ICD10 mirror; it legitimately subsumes the child (broader)
        because the activity suffix adds no clinical specificity. Weak targets SNOMED CT 434228 (Passenger
        in vehicular AND/OR traffic accident), SNOMED CT 437738 (Motor vehicle accident off public road)
        are the parent's alternate crosswalk edges, recorded as related leads. Confidence high tier:
        parent crosswalk is verified and the child adds only non-clinical context.
        """
}
mapping "V1013.2" source="V1013" target="21107000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
}
mapping "V1013.3" source="V1013" target="214640008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
